      "comment": "This generic key is used only for accessibility labels, with two related but non-identical argument sets. On a conflict-comparison card, placeholder 1 `%@` is the localized device/location phrase and placeholder 2 `%@` is the complete localized “Saved <relative time>” status. On a save card, placeholder 1 `%@` is the localized save-kind label and placeholder 2 `%@` is the complete localized subtitle describing device and relative time. Preserve placeholder 1 as the primary descriptor and placeholder 2 as its status/detail if reordered."
    },
